<title>POLAND: Mostostal-E Q2 net rises to PLN 16.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-E Q2 net rises to PLN 16.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostostal Export preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     1.82   vs    0.42 loss</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			16.15   vs    5.00</p>
<p>    net profit			    16.15   vs    5.00</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Mostostal Export SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     13.53   vs   30.66</p>
<p>    costs of sales			28.11   vs   11.10</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.02   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
